{"id": "EUVD-2026-98668", "enisaUuid": "1c974ac2-145b-3e9e-8182-d73c5e720714", "description": "Wazuh from 3.9.0 before 4.14.8 contains an uncontrolled YAML alias expansion vulnerability in yaml2json_node that allows a manager-controlled policy to exhaust agent memory. Attackers controlling the manager can push a small SCA policy with nested aliases via merged.mg to OOM-kill wazuh-modulesd on every agent in a group.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T13:27:25", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:43:37", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/security/advisories/GHSA-x8v7-g49q-ff7j", "https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/releases/tag/v4.14.8", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wazuh-3.9.0-before-4.14.8-memory-exhaustion-via-sca-yaml-alias-expansion"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-74030"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.4, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b68f1ffc-746c-38a7-a336-8d5ee4af3046", "product": {"name": "wazuh-agent", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}, "product_version": "3.9.0 <4.14.8"}, {"id": "c206c04c-fb82-30e4-81d6-82e97b4ad327", "product": {"name": "wazuh-manager", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}, "product_version": "3.9.0 <4.14.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a5e3efd2-3c18-3a65-9115-c7709071bebe", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}], "isExploited": false}